Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.37,0:00:06.71,Cap,,0,0,0,,THE LOANS WEREN'T HER
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.71,0:00:09.04,Cap,,0,0,0,,SECRET. THE SIGNATURE WAS.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.04,0:00:11.38,Cap,,0,0,0,,SHE'D BEEN PRACTISING MINE.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.00,0:00:14.05,Cap,,0,0,0,,THE NOTARY CALLED ME
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.05,0:00:15.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,THIS MORNING, ELEANOR.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.98,0:00:17.78,Cap,,0,0,0,,I HAVE NO IDEA
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.78,0:00:19.58,Cap,,0,0,0,,WHAT YOU'RE TALKING ABOUT.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.96,0:00:21.71,Cap,,0,0,0,,A DEED. SIGNED BY
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.71,0:00:23.45,Cap,,0,0,0,,ME. ON A DAY
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.45,0:00:25.19,Cap,,0,0,0,,I WAS IN CHICAGO.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.58,0:00:28.45,Cap,,0,0,0,,MOM. TELL ME SHE'S
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.45,0:00:29.17,Cap,,0,0,0,,WRONG.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.56,0:00:31.61,Cap,,0,0,0,,I WAS PROTECTING THIS
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.61,0:00:33.15,Cap,,0,0,0,,FAMILY. FROM HER.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.54,0:00:35.94,Cap,,0,0,0,,FORGERY IS A FELONY.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.94,0:00:37.13,Cap,,0,0,0,,I CHECKED.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.52,0:00:39.92,Cap,,0,0,0,,YOU WOULDN'T. NOT TO
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.92,0:00:41.12,Cap,,0,0,0,,ETHAN'S MOTHER.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.50,0:00:43.55,Cap,,0,0,0,,SHE DOESN'T HAVE TO.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.55,0:00:45.10,Cap,,0,0,0,,I ALREADY DID.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.46,0:00:51.54,Cap,,0,0,0,,THURSDAY DINNER IS STILL
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.54,0:00:53.62,Cap,,0,0,0,,ON. I'LL SET THE
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.62,0:00:54.14,Cap,,0,0,0,,TABLE.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.68,0:00:56.84,Cap,,0,0,0,,TEN CHAIRS. EVERYONE GETS
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.84,0:00:59.01,Cap,,0,0,0,,A SEAT. EVEN HER.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.01,0:01:01.17,Cap,,0,0,0,,BUT THIS TIME, I
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.17,0:01:03.33,Cap,,0,0,0,,DECIDE WHERE SHE SITS.
